sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent as Praxis / Multi-Agent
    participant Client as PraxisReviewClient
    participant WS as ManagedWorkspace
    participant VFS as SqliteVfsStorage (CAS)
    participant Proj as ProjectionEngine
    participant MCTS as MCTSEngine

    Note over Agent, VFS: 阶段一：毫秒级虚拟工作区分叉 (Fork)
    Agent->>Client: createWorkspace({ workspaceId, sourceDir })
    Client->>WS: 初始化工作区
    WS->>VFS: FastCDC 切块并存入 CAS (vfs_chunks & vfs_nodes)
    VFS-->>WS: 根 Merkle 节点哈希 (root_node_id)
    Client-->>Agent: Base Workspace 实例

    Agent->>WS: fork("candidate-branch-a")
    WS->>VFS: forkWorkspace("base", "candidate-a") (仅克隆根指针)
    VFS-->>WS: 零拷贝分叉完成 (耗时 < 3ms)
    WS-->>Agent: Forked Workspace 实例

    Note over Agent, Proj: 阶段二：受控沙箱物理投影与验证
    Agent->>WS: writeFile("core/parser.ts", optimizedAstCode)
    WS->>VFS: 写入变动分块并更新虚拟目录树
    Agent->>WS: project()
    WS->>Proj: projectWorkspace(workspaceId, tempDir)
    Proj-->>WS: 物理投影沙箱根目录 (praxis-sandbox-*)
    Agent->>Proj: runInSandbox("npm test", { timeoutMs: 30000 })
    Note over Proj: cwd 严格隔离在临时目录，超时返回 124
    Proj-->>Agent: 执行结果 (exitCode, stdout, stderr)

    Note over Agent, MCTS: 阶段三：MCTS 启发式评估与 UCT 锦标赛择优
    Agent->>MCTS: runTournament([candidateA, candidateB], targetSpec)
    MCTS->>MCTS: 计算 Delta CC 与 AST 深度增益
    MCTS->>MCTS: UCT 算法打分与回溯更新访问频次
    MCTS-->>Agent: 最优优胜策略节点 (Winner Candidate)

    Note over Agent, VFS: 阶段四：方案落盘或原子闪回 (Rollback)
    alt 方案测试未达标
        Agent->>Client: revertWorkspace("candidate-a", snapshotId)
        Client->>VFS: 原子替换 root_node_id (耗时 < 1ms)
    else 优胜方案采纳
        Agent->>Client: 合并至主工作树
    end
    Agent->>Proj: cleanOnClose() (临时物理文件零残留析构)
